Package: Vm2eData
Title: Convert Vannmiljo Monitoring Data to eData Format
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sam", "Welch", , "sam@samwelch.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for cleaning, filtering and converting Norwegian
    Vannmiljo water monitoring data into the eData templates used by
    STOPeData, plus notes on the Vannmiljo data model.
